      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-21T03:10:27.529Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6\" title=\"20220420220619_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20220420220619_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"e1obqrqh8ehgZsuM38OwDejvEAS\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6246a96b4b43625e5dc406c1f03db2c8d8ec14c6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220420220619_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 359 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Got it! Probably could have played more carefully and kept CC, but he burned himself out with his power. “Long” is definitely the proper adjective here, as I slowly chipped away with Truth Seeker and whatever Guise could throw at Spite. Scholar was invulnerable with 2 Flesh to Iron. Between those with Alchemical Redirection, Offensive Transmutation, and Guise copying his buddy there weren’t many rounds where drug-addled Spite could damage much. Now if only I had considered building up Scholar’s hand for a huge discard, I probably could have wrapped it up much sooner.</p>",
