      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-21T06:40:46.563Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Two copies of Alchemical Redirection, no way to play extra cards each round…you should only be able to buy two rounds of safety, plus at least two more after a round’s delay each with Don’t Dismiss Anything.  Did you have enough HP to survive during the non-safe rounds?  I sure didn’t.</p>",
