      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-21T12:20:41.983Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a surprisingly easy time despite losing everyone but Scholar by the end. Waiting until Spite flipped to open all the presents meant Scholar had <em>all the cards</em>, and then Guise could just copy him and have all the cards, also.</p>\n<p>Captain Cosmic contributed precisely nothing to this fight. :B</p>",
