      "username": "The_Justifier",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-04-21T16:53:58.493Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My luck was particularly terrible with Captain Cosmic, as I never saw a Dynamic Siphon after he died.  It was nothing but Augmented Allies and Cosmic Crests and such, doing precisely bupkis and immediately being slaughtered by 2+2 global damage.  I’d imagine maybe the shuffle depends on when precisely he dies?</p>",
